  <Name>Pset_HvacSensor</Name>
  <Definition>Definition from IAI: This property set is used to define the general characteristics of a sensor used in an HVAC control system.

HISTORY: New property set in IFC Release 2.0.

ISSUES: No issues to date.</Definition>
